#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:230
#: 81993b974dfd4c1988c8d160317701a8
msgid ""
"The Aileron output function provides an aileron output, with its own per-"
"channel trim and range. This is useful when you want to trim each aileron "
"separately, or if your main roll control is setup as :ref:`ELEVONS<guide-"
"elevon-plane>`, and you also want some normal ailerons."
msgstr ""
"副翼输出功能提供副翼输出，具有其自己的每通道微调和范围。当你想要分别微调每个副翼时，或者当你的主横滚控制设置为 :ref:`升降副翼<guide-"
"elevon-plane>` 且还想要一些普通副翼时，这非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:239
#: a17b91f96d034fdcb2e8510cb00aeae7
msgid ""
"The elevator output function provides an elevator output. Multiple outputs "
"are possible, each with separate per-channel trim and range. This is useful "
"when you want to trim each elevator separately, or if your main pitch "
"control is setup as :ref:`ELEVONS<guide-elevon-plane>`, and you also want "
"some normal elevator."
msgstr ""
"升降舵输出功能提供升降舵输出。多个输出是可能的，每个具有独立的每通道微调和范围。当你想要分别微调每个升降舵时，或者当你的主俯仰控制设置为 "
":ref:`升降副翼<guide-elevon-plane>` 且还想要一些普通升降舵时，这非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:250
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:483
#: 46581d39045c408a8a00289099748490 97147686affb4200b8551c1446207298
msgid ""
"Typical servo output for motor power control for vehicles. Multiple outputs "
"can be used for multi-engine vehicles. Primary power control output for "
"normal fixed-wing planes, single rotor helicopter, and rovers."
msgstr "用于控制机型电机动力的典型舵机输出。多引擎飞行器可使用多路输出。是普通固定翼飞机、单旋翼直升机和地面车辆的主油门控制输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:253
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:427
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:486
#: bfa8f8e8a7864acf860a3710cb3b8aae ceea15b7a1c8479d82965251c7bc646b
#: ebc5f3d6ee9a414db9cd67d8441c85fd
msgid "Throttle Left/ Right"
msgstr "左/右油门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:255
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:488
#: 20f713a206dd456eb7014f3aaff39c6d ff14f2b1b2444f0d8fee5b5c4eabe0c0
msgid ""
"In Plane, these outputs are for differential thrust in twin engine aircraft "
"and the amount of yaw affecting the base throttle value is determined by "
":ref:`RUDD_DT_GAIN<RUDD_DT_GAIN>`. Also, in Plane's vectored Tailsitters, "
"these are the motor outputs. In Rover, these outputs are for control of the "
"steering motors in :ref:`Skid-Steering Rovers <rover-motor-and-servo-"
"configuration-skid>`. In Copter, theses outputs are used for the Bicopter "
"motors."
msgstr ""
"在 Plane 中，这些输出用于双发飞机的差动推力，偏航对基础油门的影响程度由 :ref:`RUDD_DT_GAIN<RUDD_DT_GAIN>` "
"决定。在 Plane 的矢量尾坐式飞机中，这些是电机输出。在 Rover 中，这些输出用于控制 :ref:`差速转向地面车辆 <rover-motor-"
"and-servo-configuration-skid>` 的转向电机。在 Copter 中，这些输出用于双旋翼飞机的电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:262
#: 991f22e49fd845ca8d0afa8bbdab01c5
msgid ""
"The rudder output function provides a rudder outputs with its own per-"
"channel trim and range. Separate rudder channels are particularly useful for"
" nose wheel steering where the nose wheel may need to be reversed as "
"compared to the normal rudder channel or for multi-wheel planes."
msgstr ""
"方向舵输出功能提供方向舵输出，具有其自己的每通道微调和范围。独立的方向舵通道对于前轮转向特别有用，因为前轮相对于普通方向舵通道可能需要反向，或者用于多轮飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:271
#: 87a06579c3244403a2b3f7d26f6f0aff
msgid ""
"When a channel is set as a flap its value comes from the flap rc input "
"channel selected by assigning ``RCx_FUNCTION`` = 208 to it and/or from the "
":ref:`Automatic Flaps<automatic-flaps>` feature. The reason you may want to "
"use this instead of a RCPassThru is that you can setup multiple flap "
"channels with different trims and ranges, and you may want to take advantage"
" of the :ref:`FLAP_SLEWRATE<FLAP_SLEWRATE>` to limit the speed of flap "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"当通道设置为襟翼时，其值来自通过将 ``RCx_FUNCTION`` = 208 分配给它选择的襟翼 RC 输入通道和/或来自 "
":ref:`自动襟翼<automatic-flaps>` 功能。你可能希望使用此功能而不是 RCPassThru "
"的原因是，你可以设置具有不同微调和范围的多个襟翼通道，并且可能希望利用 :ref:`FLAP_SLEWRATE<FLAP_SLEWRATE>` "
"来限制襟翼运动速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:279
#: b68de84eba28496cbd0d7b4925cd834e
msgid ""
"The Automatic Flaps output function behaves like the Flap output, except it "
"can also accept automatic flap output control from the "
":ref:`TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT<TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT>` and "
":ref:`LAND_FLAP_PERCNT<LAND_FLAP_PERCNT>` parameters, as well as the "
":ref:`FLAP_1_SPEED <FLAP_1_SPEED>`, :ref:`FLAP_1_PERCNT<FLAP_1_PERCNT>`, "
":ref:`FLAP_2_SPEED<FLAP_2_SPEED>` and :ref:`FLAP_2_PERCNT<FLAP_2_PERCNT>` "
"parameters. in addition to manual control."
msgstr ""
"自动襟翼输出功能与「襟翼」输出类似，但它还可以接受来自 :ref:`TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT<TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT>` 和 "
":ref:`LAND_FLAP_PERCNT<LAND_FLAP_PERCNT>` 参数的自动襟翼输出控制，以及 :ref:`FLAP_1_SPEED "
"<FLAP_1_SPEED>`、:ref:`FLAP_1_PERCNT<FLAP_1_PERCNT>`、:ref:`FLAP_2_SPEED<FLAP_2_SPEED>`"
" 和 :ref:`FLAP_2_PERCNT<FLAP_2_PERCNT>` 参数，以及手动控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:284
#: 02e0a2cc98bc40058282e56a3bc7bec4
msgid ""
"If you have both an RC flap input channel set (``RCx_OPTION`` = 208) and the"
" Automatic Flaps function set, then the amount of flap applied is the higher"
" of the two."
msgstr "如果同时设置了 RC 襟翼输入通道（``RCx_OPTION`` = 208）和自动襟翼功能，则应用的襟翼量取两者中较大的一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:288
#: 6388d49431e74180847561781305933f
msgid "Flaperons"
msgstr "副翼襟翼"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:290
#: b62b3368ddb14f26a9cf3909c960c908
msgid ""
"Using SERVOn_FUNCTION 24 and 25 (FlaperonLeft / FlaperonRight) you can setup"
" flaperons, which are ailerons that double as flaps. They are very useful "
"for aircraft which have ailerons but no flaps."
msgstr ""
"使用 SERVOn_FUNCTION 24 和 25（左副翼襟翼/右副翼襟翼），你可以设置副翼襟翼，即兼作襟翼的副翼。对于有副翼但无襟翼的飞机非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:294
#: 8f3866c0a95048a4ad56516f9442af83
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Flaperon guide <flaperons-on-plane>` section for more details."
msgstr "更多详情请参阅 :ref:`副翼襟翼指南 <flaperons-on-plane>` 部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:296
#: d1d183444aaa4ec9b07f28387e7e981e
msgid ""
"Note that flaperons act like Automatic or normal flaps, described above for "
"the flap component of the output."
msgstr "请注意，对于输出的襟翼部分，副翼襟翼的作用与上述自动或普通襟翼相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:300
#: bf438438e0034d8f920cddd23a3101e4
msgid "Elevon Left/ Right"
msgstr "升降副翼 左/右"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:302
#: 0141c42952c844fd8da5cfc86ab1e26c
msgid "Provides outputs for :ref:`Elevons <guide-elevon-plane>`."
msgstr "提供 :ref:`升降副翼 <guide-elevon-plane>` 的输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:305
#: 3581ea99e5204301bbf729485db08fd0
msgid "V-tail Left/ Right"
msgstr "V 尾 左/右"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:307
#: 354af9d3623a48be9ee436e7e78af567
msgid "Provides outputs for :ref:`guide-vtail-plane`."
msgstr "提供 :ref:`guide-vtail-plane` 的输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:310
#: 237377466cf7467f8c2b5ba807ab27ae
msgid "Differential Spoilers Left/Right"
msgstr "差动扰流板 左/右"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:312
#: 1791cb60a7b94ee5b0bba4f477097cfb
msgid "See :ref:`Differential Spoilers <differential-spoilers>` section."
msgstr "见 :ref:`差动扰流板 <differential-spoilers>` 部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:319
#: 6fc2c767e62747f298922cf83d38720a
msgid ""
"The GroundSteering output function acts much like the rudder output function"
" except that it only acts when the aircraft is below "
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` altitude. At altitudes above "
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` the output will be the trim value "
"for the channel."
msgstr ""
"GroundSteering 输出功能与方向舵输出功能非常类似，区别在于它仅在飞机低于 "
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` 高度时起作用。在高于 "
":ref:`GROUND_STEER_ALT<GROUND_STEER_ALT>` 的高度时，输出将是该通道的微调值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:324
#: 1178437fb53e4543aad9eecda19ba67c
msgid ""
"See the separate page on :ref:`setting up ground steering <tuning-ground-"
"steering-for-a-plane>`"
msgstr ""
"有关地面转向设置的单独页面请参阅 :ref:`setting up ground steering <tuning-ground-steering-"
"for-a-plane>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:331
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:441
#: 66ba98cdc1a54102bca5ec5e2b1d0521 ca1d3dc2b56b4558b75abcd72e482a7b
msgid ""
"This output is for throttle control of an auxiliary :ref:`booster-motor` to "
"add an additional vertical thrust source in Multi-Copter and QuadPlane "
"applications."
msgstr "该输出用于控制辅助 :ref:`booster-motor` 的油门，为多旋翼和垂直起降固定翼应用提供额外的垂直推力来源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:337
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:446
#: 43d51f5380c54c469fe915afc5ab5cad 71d46846294047079ccb6d5c06cd1751
msgid ""
"This provides an output that reflects the ARM/DISARM state of the vehicle to"
" control a motor enable/kill switch. When ARMED, it is at SERVOx_MAX pwm, "
"and at SERVOx_MIN pwm when disarmed."
msgstr ""
"该输出反映飞行器的解锁/上锁状态，用于控制电机使能/断电开关。解锁时输出为 SERVOx_MAX PWM，上锁时输出为 SERVOx_MIN PWM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:342
#: c9122804bb79464488963e7ef481d00f
msgid ""
"This output controls the landing gear servo(s) in Copter and Plane. See "
":ref:`common-landing-gear` for more information."
msgstr "该输出控制 Copter 和 Plane 中的起落架舵机。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`common-landing-gear`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:347
#: c885ba911d8343fdadff641b9301d7c1
msgid "Airbrakes"
msgstr "气动减速板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:349
#: fd7ddf66c9104ebc8138f370a47964fa
msgid ""
"This output is for air brake control. Manual input control is via "
"``RCx_OPTION`` = 210. For more information see :ref:`airbrakes-on-plane`."
msgstr ""
"此输出用于空气制动控制。手动输入控制通过 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 210 实现。更多信息见 :ref:`airbrakes-on-"
"plane`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:353
